cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Viviani's theorem in Lean 4"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of Viviani's theorem: the classical statement for
  equilateral triangles (distances to the sides sum to the altitude), its converse, the
  weighted-average formula for every triangle, signed distances on the whole plane, and
  simplices of every dimension. No sorry, standard axioms only; re-checked by leanchecker
  and by the independent checker nanoda, with tamper tests.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: redzwn
  - name: "Claude (Anthropic)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/redzwn/viviani-lean"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-13
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formal verification
  - theorem proving
  - Euclidean geometry
  - Viviani's theorem
